 developers only, not a client requirement. -->
 - **English labels are internal (GDC developers only).** Never include
 English-label items in client questions or Jira comments to the client;
 report weak/unfitted English to the user only. See
 `sf-object-translation-deploy.mdc` "Who the English labels are for".
