 `棚卸差損：実額:AA4` collapsed into duplicate labels; the org keeps `：`. -->
 A full-width `：` separates label and API name only when the value has
 no half-width `:`; otherwise it is label text (`棚卸差損：実額:AA4` →
 label `棚卸差損：実額`, API `AA4`; `picklist_api.split_entry`).
