 Duplicate label 販売員手数料：単価 — sheet DW5 vs org BHB. -->
 When the field already exists, a sheet ApiName that differs from the org
 ApiName for the SAME label is an ERROR (`picklist.org_api`). Salesforce
 cannot rename picklist `fullName`s. Keep the org ApiName, write it back
 to col H (`picklist_api.resolve_against_org`), and add only new labels.
 <!-- Updated by Divakar N — 2026-10-26. Why: line breaks between picklist
 values in col H are now allowed; generate_xml already split on them, only
 validate_sheet and the sheet input validation rejected them. -->
 A line break separates values exactly like `;` (one value per line is
 fine; `picklist_api.split_values`). Lookups do NOT fall back to G (col H only).
